  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can help any ally outflank your foes.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Outflank<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you and an ally are flanking the same creature, the flanking bonus on attack rolls for both of you increases to +4. In addition, whenever you score a critical hit against the flanked creature, it provokes an attack of opportunity from your ally.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Outflank normally requires your ally to also have the Outflank feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
